msgid "Google Cloud Bigtable Remote Cache"
msgstr "谷歌云 Bigtable 远程缓存"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page documents the behavior of LMCache's in-process mode "
"(deprecated). Please consider using :doc:`LMCache MP mode </mp/index>` "
"for better feature support and performance. For the MP mode equivalent of"
" this page, see :doc:`/mp/l2_storage/index`."
msgstr ""
"本页记录了 LMCache 的进程内模式（已弃用）的行为。请考虑使用 :doc:`LMCache MP 模式 </mp/index>` "
"以获得更好的功能支持和性能。有关此页面的 MP 模式等效内容，请参见 :doc:`/mp/l2_storage/index`。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:12
msgid "Overview: Why Choose Bigtable?"
msgstr "概述：为什么选择 Bigtable？"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:14
msgid ""
"Cloud Bigtable is ideal for LLM serving workloads that require massive "
"scale without sacrificing performance. It offers:"
msgstr "Cloud Bigtable 非常适合需要大规模而不牺牲性能的 LLM 服务工作负载。它提供："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Massive Scalability**: Seamlessly scales to handle petabytes of KV "
"cache data with consistent, single-digit millisecond latency."
msgstr "**大规模可扩展性**：无缝扩展以处理 PB 级的 KV Cache 数据，延迟保持在稳定的个位数毫秒级。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Enterprise Reliability**: Fully managed with built-in replication, "
"zero-downtime scaling, and robust IAM security."
msgstr "**企业可靠性**：完全托管，内置复制，零停机时间扩展，以及强大的 IAM 安全性。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Flexible Storage Tiers**: Choose the right balance of cost and "
"performance for your deployment: - **SSD Tier (Recommended)**: Optimized "
"for low-latency, high-throughput caching. Recommended for primary L2 "
"cache setups where retrieval speed is critical. - **HDD Tier**: Best for "
"cost-effective, massive-scale archival storage where capacity is the "
"priority over sub-millisecond latency."
msgstr "**灵活的存储层**：为您的部署选择成本和性能的最佳平衡：- **SSD 层（推荐）**：针对低延迟、高吞吐量缓存进行了优化。推荐用于检索速度至关重要的主要 L2 缓存设置。- **HDD 层**：最适合成本效益高的大规模归档存储，在容量优先于亚毫秒延迟的情况下使用。"

