#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:106
msgid ""
"If you are serving extremely large models (e.g., Llama-3.1-405B or long-"
"context 70B models) where raw KV cache chunks exceed 240 MB, you should "
"enable LMCache's native **CacheGen** compression to quantize payloads "
"before storing them in Bigtable."
msgstr "如果您正在服务极大的模型（例如，Llama-3.1-405B 或长上下文 70B 模型），其中原始 KV Cache 块超过 240 MB，您应该启用 LMCache 的原生 **CacheGen** 压缩，以在将有效负载存储到 Bigtable 之前进行量化。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:108
msgid "Create an ``lmcache_config_compressed.yaml`` file:"
msgstr "创建一个 ``lmcache_config_compressed.yaml`` 文件："

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:127
msgid ""
"**Benefit**: Compresses the KV cache footprint by **10x to 20x** "
"(reducing a 128MB payload to ~8MB), drastically lowering Bigtable network"
" transfer latency and storage costs."
msgstr "**好处**：将 KV Cache 的占用空间压缩 **10 倍到 20 倍**（将 128MB 的负载减少到 ~8MB），大幅降低 Bigtable 网络传输延迟和存储成本。"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:130
msgid "Tutorial 2: 3-Tier Hybrid Storage (Local CPU -> Redis -> Bigtable SSD)"
msgstr "教程 2：三层混合存储（本地 CPU -> Redis -> Bigtable SSD）"

#: ../../source/kv_cache/storage_backends/bigtable.rst:132
msgid ""
"For low-latency hot caching, you can place a Redis instance in front of "
"Bigtable. Hot requests are served from Redis, while long-tail persistent "
"caches are offloaded to Bigtable."
msgstr "对于低延迟的热缓存，您可以在 Bigtable 前放置一个 Redis 实例。热请求由 Redis 提供服务，而长尾持久缓存则卸载到 Bigtable。"

